<item><title>Somalia orders UAE ambassador out within 72 hours, recalls envoy</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-orders-uae-ambassador-out-within-72-hours-recalls-ee3935/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-orders-uae-ambassador-out-within-72-hours-recalls-ee3935/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>The cabinet said the measures answer alleged Emirati interference in Somalia&apos;s sovereignty, territorial integrity and national security, and the UAE foreign ministry had not.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:37:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-orders-uae-ambassador-out-within-72-hours-recalls-ee3935/share.jpg" length="42828" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-orders-uae-ambassador-out-within-72-hours-recalls-ee3935/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
